# LF everywhere: mecha, Minecraft and the CI checks all expect it. CRLF crept in through uploads from Windows
# (`hygiene` in CI reports any tracked text file that has it).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mcfunction text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.mcmeta text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.zip binary
*.png binary
